{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/react-native-1/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"f5647a9a-bb5c-5ef1-b14f-fb61d27f3c5e","html":"<p>终于，将正式开始 APP 开发之旅。本篇主要学习 RN 的一些概念，有一个大概的了解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"core-component\"><a href=\"#core-component\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Core Component</h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">TextInput</code>、<code class=\"language-text\">ScrollView</code>、<code class=\"language-text\">FlatList</code>、<code class=\"language-text\">SectionList</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"platform-specific-code\"><a href=\"#platform-specific-code\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Platform-Specific Code</h2>\n<p>和平台有差异的代码，可以使用 <code class=\"language-text\">Platform</code> 判断当前环境。</p>\n<p>或者 <code class=\"language-text\">Platform-specific extensions</code> 拆分代码，RN 会根据当前环境自动加载带相应后缀的文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"env-setup\"><a href=\"#env-setup\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 1